    "font size" : 6.968,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Bank of England Governor Mark Carney added further praise for the new FPC hires. He said Dame Colette – also a former chairwoman of the regulator Ofcom – has “led the way in developing and embedding better standards of conduct across thebankingsector”."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
