    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "Chancellor Philip Hammond said: “The Financial Policy Committee’s importance to the protection and resilience of our economy cannot be overstated, which is why we have some of the finest talent in finance onit."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
